              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngosuku lwesithathu ngibelethile, lona wesifazane wabeletha naye; futhi sasindawonye; kwakungekho mfokazi kanye nathi endlini, ngaphandle kwethu sobabili endlini.",
