              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wavuka phakathi kobusuku, wathatha indodana yami eceleni kwami, incekukazi yakho ilele, wayilalisa esifubeni sakhe, wamlalisa ofileyo wakhe esifubeni sami.",
          "type": "text",
