              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho ngivuka ekuseni ukuba ngincelise umntanami, bheka, wayesefile; kodwa lapho ngikucabangela ekuseni, bheka, kwakungeyona indodana yami engayizala.",
          "type": "text",
