              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owesifazana omntwana ophilayo wakhuluma enkosini, ngoba izibilini zakhe zanxanela indodana yakhe, wathi: O nkosi yami, mnikeni umntwana ephila, lingambulali. Kodwa omunye wathi: Kangabi ngowami kumbe owakho, kodwa yehlukaniseni.",
          "type": "text",
